          %h2#references References
          %h3#general General
          %p The mathematical axioms of CFT, as well as its relevance for surface phenomena goes back to
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexander+Belavin"}> Alexander Belavin
              ,
              = succeed "," do
